Official DakuOS logo assets.

Preferred files (decoded JPEGs, installed into the live image):

- logo-boot.jpg   — boot splash, login, GRUB, wallpaper
- logo-icon.jpg   — smaller icon variant

Also accepted by the branding hook (copied to logo-boot.jpg if needed):

- boot-logo.jpeg / boot-logo.jpg / logo-boot.jpeg / *.png

Optional base64 fallbacks (decoded at build time; bad input is skipped,
not a hard failure):

- logo-boot.jpg.b64  or  logo-boot.jpg.b64.part*
- logo-icon.jpg.b64

Processed by config/hooks/live/030-dakuos-branding.hook.chroot
